    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[About Koi-Koi VR: Love Blossoms]</h2>Become the protagonist in an all-new VR romance adventure game!<br>Enjoy a life full of excitement with two charming sisters at a hot spring resort!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/17ee8cfcd74688739e259cef2b74981d.poster.avif?t=1738834741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/17ee8cfcd74688739e259cef2b74981d.webm?t=1738834741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/17ee8cfcd74688739e259cef2b74981d.mp4?t=1738834741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Koume\uff08Voice: \u6c11\u5b89\u3068\u3082\u3048\uff09</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/6dd8f99196c294adcbb1eba46e61abdc.avif?t=1738834741\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sakura\uff08Voice: \u4f0a\u30f6\u5d0e\u7dbe\u9999\uff09</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/d9cace1505702f83578e537285236371.avif?t=1738834741\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Itsuha\uff08Voice: \u5927\u5bae\u82e5\u8449\uff09</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/dca6fa8184bc5edf42bc6c750da9ca65.avif?t=1738834741\" /></div><br><br>Costumes<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/5192822a9225b2949256099bf05f8038.avif?t=1738834741\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Outline]</h2>The hot spring resort Tokoharu Koi-Koi Hot Spring is a ryokan famous for its plum and cherry trees, which bloom all year round.<br>However, a mysterious storm caused the two trees to lose all their beautiful blooms a few years ago.<br>The ryokan now faces a crisis\u2014will it have to close down?<br><br>Having inherited this ryokan, you meet two sisters there who you discover to be old childhood friends.<br>\u2014The cool and composed older sister Koume, and shy younger sister Sakura.<br>Spending time under the same roof, the three of you work towards restoring the ryokan to its former glory.<br><br>The innkeeper Itsuha tells you something completely unexpected.<br>The key to making the plum and cherry trees bloom again is forming a connection with the two sisters in both body and soul!<br>Do you choose just one of the girls, or perhaps both? It's up to you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[A variety of fun gameplay]</h2>Become the protagonist and experience the story in Adventure Mode.<br>Improve your compatibility with the heroines through your choices in conversation!<br><br>Experience multiple endings depending on your compatibility with each girl!<br>The heroines are fully voiced in Adventure Mode.<br><br>Challenge the hot spring's various minigames like VR table tennis in Action Mode!<br>*Action Mode can be accessed by playing through the main game.<br><br>Take a break from Adventure Mode and play with the heroines using the controller!<br>There are bonus modes where you can interact with the heroine whose heart belongs to you and improve your compatibility.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MiniGames</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/4c23aee5cccfcdabb46bb657b9d8de88.avif?t=1738834741\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kissing</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/35047c15e48853deacd7cbd8890c5720.poster.avif?t=1738834741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/35047c15e48853deacd7cbd8890c5720.webm?t=1738834741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/35047c15e48853deacd7cbd8890c5720.mp4?t=1738834741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Massage</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/36c18e49034b43ad1b51843c197b4c3a.poster.avif?t=1738834741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/36c18e49034b43ad1b51843c197b4c3a.webm?t=1738834741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/36c18e49034b43ad1b51843c197b4c3a.mp4?t=1738834741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Make love bloom in this hot spring story in full VR!</strong><br><br><strong>\u2605\u2605[DLC] &quot;Koi-Koi: Love Blossoms Non-VR Edition,&quot; which can be played without a VR headset, is also available.\u2605\u2605</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[About Koi-Koi VR: Love Blossoms]</h2>Become the protagonist in an all-new VR romance adventure game!<br>Enjoy a life full of excitement with two charming sisters at a hot spring resort!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/17ee8cfcd74688739e259cef2b74981d.poster.avif?t=1738834741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/17ee8cfcd74688739e259cef2b74981d.webm?t=1738834741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/17ee8cfcd74688739e259cef2b74981d.mp4?t=1738834741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Koume\uff08Voice: \u6c11\u5b89\u3068\u3082\u3048\uff09</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/6dd8f99196c294adcbb1eba46e61abdc.avif?t=1738834741\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sakura\uff08Voice: \u4f0a\u30f6\u5d0e\u7dbe\u9999\uff09</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/d9cace1505702f83578e537285236371.avif?t=1738834741\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Itsuha\uff08Voice: \u5927\u5bae\u82e5\u8449\uff09</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/dca6fa8184bc5edf42bc6c750da9ca65.avif?t=1738834741\" /></div><br><br>Costumes<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/5192822a9225b2949256099bf05f8038.avif?t=1738834741\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Outline]</h2>The hot spring resort Tokoharu Koi-Koi Hot Spring is a ryokan famous for its plum and cherry trees, which bloom all year round.<br>However, a mysterious storm caused the two trees to lose all their beautiful blooms a few years ago.<br>The ryokan now faces a crisis\u2014will it have to close down?<br><br>Having inherited this ryokan, you meet two sisters there who you discover to be old childhood friends.<br>\u2014The cool and composed older sister Koume, and shy younger sister Sakura.<br>Spending time under the same roof, the three of you work towards restoring the ryokan to its former glory.<br><br>The innkeeper Itsuha tells you something completely unexpected.<br>The key to making the plum and cherry trees bloom again is forming a connection with the two sisters in both body and soul!<br>Do you choose just one of the girls, or perhaps both? It's up to you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[A variety of fun gameplay]</h2>Become the protagonist and experience the story in Adventure Mode.<br>Improve your compatibility with the heroines through your choices in conversation!<br><br>Experience multiple endings depending on your compatibility with each girl!<br>The heroines are fully voiced in Adventure Mode.<br><br>Challenge the hot spring's various minigames like VR table tennis in Action Mode!<br>*Action Mode can be accessed by playing through the main game.<br><br>Take a break from Adventure Mode and play with the heroines using the controller!<br>There are bonus modes where you can interact with the heroine whose heart belongs to you and improve your compatibility.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MiniGames</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/4c23aee5cccfcdabb46bb657b9d8de88.avif?t=1738834741\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kissing</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840350/extras/35047c15e48853deacd7cbd8890c5720.poster.avif?t=1738834741\" ><source sr